# PlanOS 3.0 ??Spec-first, code-first execution rule (2026-10-22)

Apply this rule **to PlanOS work only**. This file is a Cursor configuration rule, not a claim that the product features exist. Before acting, verify you are in `happysuyeun-rgb/plan_os` and compare your current branch to remote `main` and open PRs.

## Documents to read before implementing a feature

1. `docs/plans/CURSOR_SPEC_DRIVEN_EXECUTION_STRATEGY_2026-10-22.md`
2. `docs/quality/PLANOS_SCREEN_FUNCTION_CROSS_AUDIT_V4_2026-10-22.md`
3. `docs/product/FUNCTIONAL_SPEC_V1_2026-10-20.md` for F-ID and STAFF-ID
